---
layout: base.njk
theme: theme-kelp-light
title: Games · wobpager
description: Arduboy games by FreezingSnail, playable in the browser.
permalink: /games/
---

<section class="kelp-study-page game-page">
  <header class="kelp-study-intro game-intro">
    <p class="eyebrow">/ games</p>
    <h1>Small worlds<br>for a tiny screen.</h1>
    <p class="hero-copy">Arduboy games about mazes, space, and the weird life cycle of a jellyfish. Every game runs in the browser through the Ardens simulator, served from this site.</p>
  </header>

  <div class="game-grid">
    {% for game in games %}
      <a class="game-card" href="{{ ("/games/" + game.slug + "/") | url }}">
        <img class="game-cover" src="{{ game.cover | url }}" alt="{{ game.coverAlt }}" width="128" height="64">
        <div class="game-card-copy">
          <p class="meta-label">/ {{ game.year }} · {{ game.genre }}</p>
          <h2>{{ game.title }}</h2>
          <p>{{ game.summary }}</p>
          <span class="game-card-cta">Play in browser &rarr;</span>
        </div>
      </a>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>

  <p class="game-credit">Browser playback by <a href="https://github.com/tiberiusbrown/Ardens">Ardens</a>, MIT licensed. No emulator service is involved: the player and game files are served from this site.</p>
</section>
